version: "0.1.0"
license: "MIT"
repository-code: "https://github.com/nariew111/IDEA"
abstract: "IDEA separates SNP selection for sparse genomic measurement from marker selection for phenotype prediction. IDEA-design uses genomic features and population-specific imputation calibration to prioritize assay markers. IDEA-GP selects trait-adaptive prediction markers using association evidence, linkage disequilibrium and optional imputation-quality information in a nested cross-validation workflow. The repository provides core software, usage guides and an artificial IDEA-design example. The IDEA-design web resource is available at https://alphaindex.zju.edu.cn/IDEA ."
keywords:
  - genomic-prediction
  - snp-array-design
  - imputation
  - uk-biobank
  - pig-genomic-selection
  - optuna
  - ridge-regression
  - snp-blup
